Nova interface:
	Criar o arquivo do pacote (.srv)
	Adicionar o arquivo em CMakeLists.txt
	Recompilar o pacote das  interfaces! (colcon build)
	
	Teste com
		ros2 interface show PACOTE/srv/NOME_INTERFACE
		Ex: ros2 interface show map_interfaces/srv/GetMapSerial
		
	Teste de acesso da interface
		ros2 service call /TOPIC_NAME PACOTE/srv/NOME_INTERFACE
		Ex: ros2 service call /get_map_dims map_interfaces/srv/GetMapDims

